Supplier → SEDG’s solar inverters and storage systems → Customer satisfaction → Market share growth → Increased R&D investment → Improved product differentiation.  

SEDG benefits from a virtuous cycle where customer demand for reliable, scalable solar solutions drives market share gains, which in turn fund innovation to maintain its competitive edge.  

